{"4632530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dog of Wisdom", "steam_appid": 4632530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the world as Pepper the dachshund as you fly around and bark at nothing! Gain wisdom in search of the galaxy's most dog-friendly foods -- but watch out for the toxic ones. Learn the difference by playing. Featuring: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel-perfect side-scrolling graphics in the style of classic handheld games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four levels of cosmic fun, natural splendor, and moral vice to challenge even the most good of dogs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus stages of tail-wagging fundis.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys or WASD : Directional Pad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z or J : Action, Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X or K : Dash, Bark at Nothing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc: Pause Menu</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the world as Pepper the dachshund as you fly around and bark at nothing! Gain wisdom in search of the galaxy's most dog-friendly foods -- but watch out for the toxic ones. Learn the difference by playing. Featuring: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel-perfect side-scrolling graphics in the style of classic handheld games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four levels of cosmic fun, natural splendor, and moral vice to challenge even the most good of dogs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus stages of tail-wagging fundis.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys or WASD : Directional Pad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z or J : Action, Jump</p><